# Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 (MoE, 3B active, non-thinking only), RedHatAI INT4 (llm-compressor
# GPTQ, compressed-tensors W4A16, symmetric, group 128; every Linear including the router is
# 4-bit, only lm_head stays bf16; bf16 activations as declared). The template has no thinking
# switch and injects nothing.
# Measured on an RTX 3090 (docs/research/candidates.md): 15.68 GiB weights, 4.21 GiB KV cache
# (45,936 tokens), ~90 s to healthy.
# Text-only checkpoint (no --language-model-only); --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 and
# --max-num-seqs=16 as in the Qwen3.5-architecture presets; --generation-config=vllm ignores the
# upload's sampling defaults.
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=RedHatAI/Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507-quantized.w4a16
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=e9c59cdcca9d73f24adeda09660af904a79f509f
JEVEMU_VLLM_DTYPE=auto
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.90
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS=
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 --generation-config=vllm'
